{"availability":"available","full":"Mereithhh/vanblog","name":"vanblog","description":"A self-hosted blogging system with Markdown editing, a full admin dashboard, analytics, image hosting, comments, and automatic HTTPS.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":3584,"forks":500,"created":"2022-05-18T03:30:49Z","updated":"2026-09-17T01:09:33Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://vanblog.mereith.com","topics":["blog","nextjs","nodejs","typescript"],"demo":"https://blog-demo.mereith.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.540Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.540Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.540Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.540Z","stars":3584,"forks":500}],"technologies":["Next.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted personal blogging system with a complete admin dashboard, Markdown editing, built-in analytics, image hosting, and comments.","Website & documentation · Live demo · Changelog","The demo admin username and password are both demo. The documentation and application interface are currently primarily in Chinese; internationalization is on the roadmap."],"features":["A complete blogging system. A public blog, admin dashboard, and backend API, with responsive layouts and automatic light/dark modes for both readers and authors.","Static pages with incremental updates. The Next.js frontend uses static generation (SSG) and incremental static regeneration (ISR), so content changes do not require rebuilding every page. Pages are CDN-friendly, with…","Markdown publishing. A ByteMD editor with Mermaid diagrams, mathematical formulas, custom highlight blocks, an emoji picker, and a shortcut for the more marker. Upload local or clipboard images directly from the editor,…","Tools for readers. Tables of contents, code copying, categories, tags, search, password-protected articles and categories, friend links, donation links, custom navigation, and RSS feeds.","Built-in analytics. Visitor statistics and dashboards, plus support for Google Analytics and Baidu Analytics."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mereithhh/vanblog/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"764cce68afa289d2154c79011f5c18437aca40330f63996a7dc2943a4c2d86db","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.690Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.690Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted personal blogging system with a complete admin dashboard, Markdown editing, built-in analytics, image hosting, and comments.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mereithhh/vanblog/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The admin dashboard provides import/export, version and update notices, and access to login and Caddy logs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mereithhh/vanblog/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"764cce68afa289d2154c79011f5c18437aca40330f63996a7dc2943a4c2d86db","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mereithhh/vanblog/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.690Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-17T01:09:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mereithhh/vanblog/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:53.691Z","hash":"764cce68afa289d2154c79011f5c18437aca40330f63996a7dc2943a4c2d86db","originalBytes":10030,"storedBytes":10030,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["admin","vanblog","vanblog.sh","custom","documentation","support","blog","deployment","system","code","dashboard","frontend","image","images","issues","pull","see","add","after","bash","built-in","changelog","demo","docker","donation","github","guide","historical","history","internationalization","license","maintainer","markdown","open","pages","public","requests","run","script","site","static","storage","tests","analytics","analytics.","automated","automatic","backend","below.","blogging","both","categories","changes","chinese","c